  "goodToKnow": "Das Resümee is a summary or conclusion: ein Resümee ziehen (to take stock), ein positives Resümee. It comes from French résumé, but in Germany it doesn't mean CV; that's der Lebenslauf (though in Switzerland and Austria the word is sometimes used that way). Resümieren means to summarise. Synonyms: die Zusammenfassung, das Fazit, die Bilanz. Plural: die Resümees."
